WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 11 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Excuse me? Marriage? To this nobody?

2
00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.160
Of course she's mad, she's gorgeous, rich, rides a dragon.

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.720
I appreciate the gesture, Duke Valmont, but I'm way out of Lady Beatrix's league.

4
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:14.240
Shut your mouth, gutter rat! Not your place to reject me!

5
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.480
Your parents died defending this order, they trusted me to raise you.

6
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.120
They, I am securing your future with a man I can trust.

7
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.640
My lord, this is a public insult to Lady Beatrix.

8
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.680
In days she takes the Trials and her oath, her future belongs to a hero.

9
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.960
The Heavenbreaker has proven Aris' potential, I'll sponsor him myself.

10
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.560
My word is final.

11
00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:39.040
Fine, we'll see about that.

12
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.760
He's going to get eaten alive at the Trials.

13
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.720
Not fit to shine my boots, let alone marry me.

14
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:45.920
The egg!

15
00:00:45.920 --> 00:01:02.530
Duke Valmont, I didn't come for a reward.

16
00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.530
I'm Headmaster Thorn's attendant.

17
00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.730
I ruined a dragon egg. He sent me to you.

18
00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.330
You have to save it.

19
00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.330
Victor Thorn sent you.

20
00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:13.330
This must be serious.

21
00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:15.330
Let me see the egg.

22
00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:32.940
The blast! Did I crush it? Did I kill it?
